{"targets":[{"isStage":true,"name":"Stage","variables":{"`jEk@4|i[#Fk?(8x)AV.-my variable":["my variable",0]},"lists":{},"broadcasts":{"|f%/_f:@;EO.=)q}J7Uk":"end"},"blocks":{},"comments":{"p3KIB$^6FvUSEd_qk-(A":{"blockId":null,"x":105,"y":14,"width":1455,"height":1249,"minimized":false,"text":"Теперь Я Знаю Алфавит\n\n(After the question mark gem is finished with the backstory, М, У, З, А, Н, Ж, Ф, Ъ, Ы, Ь, and Ю are feeling very sad because they understood Д's horrible timeline. They all look at Д's dead corpse which now has no pupils. And since everyone is sad, they didn't know what to do. Ъ and Ь didn't know what to do but to cry. Ы didn't know what to do but to hug their children and head out of the lair. Ж didn't know what to do but to droopy his antennas and wings, and sob quietly. Ф didn't know what to do but to comfort Ж. And then the inside lair gets zoomed out all the way outside and showing Я. Я seeing the scene knew what to do.)\nЯ: Я... (Don't worry, I'll make it right if I reverse time...) >While closing his eyes and letting his ellipses moons orbit around him the opposite direction very fast forming a ring as the background turns purple. The ring starts to rotate<.\nК: >Flying and seeing the ring< К... (What the...) >Л and О sees the ring to< В, Т, and Ш also sees the ring. When the ring is almost rotated all the way around the lair as Н and Ц watched when light is coming, Н and Ц looks at each other.\nЦ: Ц! (Keep the question mark gem! It's yours now!) >As he makes the question mark gem levitate by using his eyestalks and throwing the gem in Н's mouth giving him the question mark gem power.<\n(Я successfully rotated the ring all the way around. And that is when time was reversed extremely fast as many of the moons pass by the screen as the series was reversed all the way back to the event when Д was beaten up as a lowercase. After the part came, Н was a lowercase again as the question mark symbol in his pupils fade. >Then Д touched Н who looked at him from behind and he is about to fall which he did< Д!!!!! (WAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!!!!) >Then he got hurt very badly and sits up feeling sad. Л, М, and О stood close to Н. \nН: >Zooms to him as everything in the background turns black.< Н? (Where am I?) >He the looks at himself, then О who made him remember him hitting him, then Л which made him remember being mean to him with О<\nЛ from the memory: Л. (What are you going to do about it little wimp, cry?)\nН: >Then sees poor Д sitting sadly in the light which made him remember him being nice to him< \nД from the memory: Д. (I'm here for you.)\n(Then Н looks down and what he sees is a reflection of his uppercase self. With a picture of Л, М, himself, О betraying Д in one pupil. And a picture of Д about to kill Б as З watched with sadness and himself watching in horror behind him in his other pupil. And then the word, ТРУСЛИВЫЙ with the real Ы in the word, appears.)\nН: >After seeing what he saw, he then stood up< Н! (That's it, I'm coming for you Д!) He is about to bravely walk over to Д, when З's behind blocks him in the way. But Н wasn't being cowardly, in fact, he was so brave that he got past him and continues to walk to Д. Even if he sees Л and О, he continues to ass him making Л and О raise their eyelids. And that is when he made it to poor Д<\nД: >Shadow appears, he looks up and was surprised< Д? (Н?) >What's surprising for Л, М, О, and Д is that Н is standing right in front of the 2  protecting Д. After Д knew what he saw, he then smiles joyfully< Д! (Wow! That was so nice of you!) \n(Л and О looks at each other angrily and then looks at Д and Н and are ready to headbutt them. Л leapt up and kicked Д, while О leapt up and headbutted Н also giving him a black eye. Д and Н gazed each other with joy while being kicked) \nД: >While gazing at Н with joy< Д! (I miss you buddy!)\nН: >While gazing at Д with happiness< Н! (I miss you to pal!)\n(Then those two got hurt very badly and sits up while looking at each other happily. Then Д cries out semicolon gem, and Н cries out a question mark gem. Then those two gems come together and formed an ampersand. And then the ampersand breaks apart as each gem returns to the two letters that were cried out before. The semicolon gem returns to Д which he now owns, and the question mark gems returns to Н which he now owns. Even though these two letters were still hurt, Н still got up and helped Д up. After he was up, he smiled. And then both of them start to go to Д's lair. П and З were still interrupted as З was still ran over. But then Н ran to П and hugged her)\nП: П? (Oh?) \n(Н cries tears of joy as he remembers her being nice to him as the exclamation mark gem was cried out and appeared. Then he and П looks at each other with smiles. After П kissed him, he then leaves to catch up with Д. When he was caught up, both of them went to Д's lair. After they arrived, they both walked all the way up the the view/balcony up above the hole together. When they looked at the viewers, Н smiled with one tooth missing and a black eye he still has. Д smiles to but has sharp teeth now. This indicates that Д didn't became evil and lonely again because now he has a friend who reunited with him. Б, Й, П, Х, Щ, and Э were never killed. Г, Е, Ё, И, Р, and С were never captured. There were no heroes. Those are all due to Н helping to be friends with Д again, making him not evil. That makes Н and Д be best friends and roommates in Д's lair for the rest of the life. And that is when the series end with Д's lair zooming out. Also revealing Я as a lowercase planet)\nЯ: >Sees the whole scene and was happy< Я! (Now that's more like it, a much better and happy ending!) >As he looks at the viewers with a smile. After he spoke, he then shuts his eyes and smiles because he's glad that the timeline is altered and everyone is saved when they grew up. And that is when the series officially ended<"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"backdrop1","bitmapResolution":1,"dat